[{"client_msg_id":"1482bf1a-d604-4871-a5a3-9f5c825daeb9","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"あとでちゃんとよみます","ts":"1630548959.166200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NwBBD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"60a03700-505a-4de7-8065-851675c184df","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"なるほど、 hacky っぽいですね","ts":"1630548892.165600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"t90"}]},{"client_msg_id":"783e40d4-5a48-421a-8f10-656144c7ba49","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"何の参考にもならないかもですが、この記事でもラッパープログラムを書いて連携させる方式を取っているような気がします。\n\u003chttps://ataylor.io/blog/cgolinking/\u003e","ts":"1630548833.165200","attachments":[{"fallback":"Aaron Taylor - Linking Dynamic C++ Libraries with Go","id":1,"title":"Aaron Taylor - Linking Dynamic C++ Libraries with Go","title_link":"https://ataylor.io/blog/cgolinking/","text":"Creating a Go wrapper around a cross-platform build process for a dynamically built and linked C++ library","blocks":null,"service_name":"ataylor.io","service_icon":"https://ataylor.io/favicon-32x32.png","from_url":"https://ataylor.io/blog/cgolinking/","original_url":"https://ataylor.io/blog/cgolinking/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"S6KY0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4b726cde-8927-4570-8d68-78dc93709975","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"dlopen するようなコードを自動生成するだけだから実質そんなかわんないか","ts":"1630548326.163600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Wmi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a3748143-35b3-440e-894a-6dc88d6360e8","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"プロキシというかアダプター？","ts":"1630548247.163100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mCzB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"12118044-92ca-4986-a7f7-8f807bd1aa1d","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"値を受け渡すだけの小さなプロキシプログラムを噛ませるとか何とかも考えられるんですが…。","ts":"1630548224.162800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DTj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2b26c250-c300-4179-9a77-8ca09a3a6f02","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"確かにダイナミックリンクしろと書かれていますね。","ts":"1630548079.161700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LYd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0ae945f3-1459-412e-a726-ebb6d23d1764","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"静的リンクができないので (直接関数を呼ぶような) Cgo すらつかえず、とてもつらい","ts":"1630548033.161400","edited":{"user":"UERCTTT8B","ts":"1630548352.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qbx8n"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1b1e5725-d0da-43ac-9afd-55f74c0fae7d","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"諸事情により機能がとっととほしいので、必要な API は先に手で実装してしまって、あとで汎用的な解を考えようと思います","ts":"1630547915.160600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XAjdk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"be58b31d-9777-4788-a9bd-763e0faa5df8","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"それそれ","ts":"1630547827.159400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UI1rB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"31691669-bee6-4776-b8e1-1e18ded76f08","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"JSONインターフェイスって多分これの事を言ってらっしゃると思うんですけど、自動生成にあんま期待するなみたいな内容が書かれてますね…。\n\u003chttps://partner.steamgames.com/doc/sdk/api#flat_interface\u003e","ts":"1630547754.159100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6zW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"08524e22-04c7-42bd-a9da-d0ffc1e02135","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"存在の有無が事前確認可能なら panic でもギリギリゆるされるかなあ","ts":"1630545734.158100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"S2Ah"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7bd62ea5-9fd8-49d0-ab55-b43e32277103","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"上にあるとおり、FFIで何らかのSDKを呼び出した際に未定義のメソッドを無理やり触られた場合はどっちの方がいいんだろ…個人的にはクラッシュ（panic）させるまででもないよなと思いますが。","ts":"1630545470.157500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NKR7z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"14fa08dc-3e76-4ea5-82e6-cd53945f081b","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"アプリケーションコードなら、`log.Fatal(err)` とかかな","ts":"1630545174.155600","edited":{"user":"U06ECBRTJ","ts":"1630545189.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"D1X="}]},{"client_msg_id":"241A01A3-FF29-4EED-95DC-7A1DE1F6C669","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"そうじゃないいわゆるエラーは多値で返すのがマナー","ts":"1630545065.154300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BxN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2911261C-C0D6-47C3-AB42-2806F9183B0D","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"あとpanicは静的な検査の代わりとしても使います\nありえない列挙型の値とか","ts":"1630545038.153700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nPTNw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eec0e694-6680-4e22-b0d3-2af208daf98a","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"encoding/json とかも recover していた気がするな","ts":"1630544303.152700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ILE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"57455a20-bc5a-49a6-b5d7-73d7f617afeb","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"testing とかテスト中に panic しても一応捕捉できるように内部で recover しているとか、そういう特殊な用途に限られますね recover","ts":"1630544285.152200","edited":{"user":"UERCTTT8B","ts":"1630544295.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2u8q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ea9027f7-63f8-4896-86c9-719c0d79d091","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"多値便利。","ts":"1630544258.151200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"i04=D"}]},{"client_msg_id":"64dc8022-d39b-4a1e-8d1b-56985a7ea812","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"関数が複数の値を返せるから、そこにerror含めるだけですね。","ts":"1630544204.150100","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1630546852.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nR7jd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6a6bc519-46e7-41a7-9d85-4a2f148074c4","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"なかなか難しいというか考え方がそもそも違うという単にそれだけでは。\n例外よりGoのerrorの方がハンドリングしやすいと思いますけどね。","ts":"1630544179.149400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cn5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e819831a-7045-4a60-85e5-74a8fcec7dbd","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"panicがそこまで重篤な意味を持つのであれば設計としてなかなか難しいところになりますね…。","ts":"1630543847.147800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VDRL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a5f95584-d929-49b3-8d66-633071c280ac","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"PythonだったらFFIで（今のところ）まだ実装されていない関数を無理やり呼ぼうとしても大半は例外投げられて終わりな事が多い気もするんですよね。たまにインタプリタが落ちるような雑実装もありますが。","ts":"1630543387.147000","edited":{"user":"U022PB40WAF","ts":"1630543454.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2G3B"}]},{"client_msg_id":"04d848bd-6aea-4ed9-8e6b-b85ffb131baa","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"エラーを受けてどう扱うか（落とすかどうか）は一番上のレイヤで考える事みたいなイメージがある","ts":"1630543337.146100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8WDb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c197cbce-1a85-4df8-b3c7-173ca0a0d715","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"基本errorインターフェースを愚直に取り回しますからね","ts":"1630543241.144500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jP5K"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ba46d4d1-9f2a-4962-a1f9-4f7e5865a6fb","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"他の言語みたいに適当にpanic呼べばいいやって訳にはいかないんすね…。現時点で非対応の関数が呼び出されたとしてもメインプロセスを早急に落とさせないといけないレベルではないですし。","ts":"1630543075.143000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vxSKP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a89423ef-0305-4cfd-a5aa-88f9fb469022","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"あーそうか、panicってランタイムレベルでしか出さないでしょと思ってたけど、コードの中でも発生させられるのか\nそれ自体は知ってたけどそう利用するという発想がなかった","ts":"1630542913.140700","edited":{"user":"U01D44KSY9Z","ts":"1630542940.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OaDmN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9b040db4-b50e-4f8f-ad41-f05805d97087","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/Raspberly/status/1433064847256604676\u003e","ts":"1630542623.136200","thread_ts":"1630542623.136200","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/Raspberly|@Raspberly\u003e: Unityのロゴも進化してきた。。。\n #Unityと歩んだ日々 \u003chttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/E-NE4OdVUAMjq1u.jpg\u003e","id":1,"author_name":"ラズ","author_subname":"@Raspberly","author_link":"https://twitter.com/Raspberly/status/1433064847256604676","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1221967318864891905/j0H03zkb_normal.png","text":"Unityのロゴも進化してきた。。。\n #Unityと歩んだ日々 \u003chttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/E-NE4OdVUAMjq1u.jpg\u003e","image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/E-NE4OdVUAMjq1u.jpg","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1630504259,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/Raspberly/status/1433064847256604676","original_url":"https://twitter.com/Raspberly/status/1433064847256604676"}],"reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"E9O1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2ef10379-63dc-4c7f-ba77-a54a7d9702ef","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"パッケージ内部でpanic\u0026amp; recoverしてる奴、たまにいるんすよ。","ts":"1630542606.135900","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1630542650.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NI4="}]},{"client_msg_id":"27060e3c-042b-4908-b034-9737f6543f6a","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"「関数から呼び出されうる関数ではerrorを返すのみに留めるべし」みたいなのとは違う話です？","ts":"1630542382.133900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3Wo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5986b6b2-2d9b-42d4-bf39-4365cc89ee4e","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"仮にあるパッケージが例外としてpanic使ってたら、それだけでどんな良い機能を提供していても、採用するか悩むレベル。","ts":"1630542276.132000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"voR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8f654042-c352-4295-850a-9a96aa797e9c","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"Goのpanicはセグフォみたいなものと捉えてる\n捕捉外のエラー","ts":"1630542253.131500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jSoQz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d0b5fa24-5cdd-4716-a6ef-1d46f247cb60","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"位置づけ的にはカーネルの panic に近い。recoverできちゃうけど、例外のつもりで使われるとほんと困る。","ts":"1630542219.130900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruho","count":1,"users":["U022PB40WAF"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZoOg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4ac947bd-d080-4c4c-9bd3-868fe9007fa0","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"Goのpanicはいわゆる例外とは違うのだよ…","ts":"1630542181.130000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LzE0R"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ea4e77f6-56df-48b2-8b3f-a6555289277e","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"GoとRustだけでしたっけ？例外を投げるのthrowじゃなくてpanicというの。","ts":"1630541939.129400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uW5SB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d075c474-e498-4cbe-8ae1-a0508b1b76f6","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"今更ながら例外をpanicというよりhysteriaの方が語彙的に合ってたんじゃないかと思いますね。リーナスが「hysteriaお断り」と言い出すだけになりそうだけど。","ts":"1630541845.128900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mejZ6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bb1064df-cf6f-4683-ab02-350ee4941273","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"適当に panic させたりとかします","ts":"1630508602.127500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"q/b"}]},{"client_msg_id":"15329c9a-7754-4132-8052-81c9129fda9f","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"まあ全部実装する必要はないと思うんで","ts":"1630508598.127200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wdOOx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4d043e04-19ec-4f97-97d9-9d1882e5be71","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"最初から完璧はできないとはいえ、つらいですね","ts":"1630508480.126900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PS+sb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0f91d708-8996-4dd8-ad9b-9eaf594ce03b","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"そもそもなぜか定義されていない型もあったりする","ts":"1630508442.126600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XaEA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b3670fb6-c96f-4e3b-ae90-a9c49e1b8812","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"型の定義が関数ポインタ含めて C まんまだし","ts":"1630508436.126300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jGcIl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"89ad61f5-1e5b-4993-8b94-2a79a2f4084e","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"Steamworks API は JSON 定義があるのでバインディングが簡単にできるかと思いきや","ts":"1630508426.126000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tEUX6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ae5d6f15-bcf1-443c-9483-432c291f77c7","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"あ、これは流れに関係ないやつ。","ts":"1630542635.136400","thread_ts":"1630542623.136200","parent_user_id":"U06BRP8VD","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"z8f=8"}]}]
